  "The secret to a great OS is 10% kernel, 90% pure Onizuka energy! 🏍️"
  "Fuyutsuki-sensei is watching... Quick! Act like a responsible teacher!"
  "Distracted by Kadena-sensei's charm? Focus! We have Linux kernels to compile!"
